# The THPS link, all pressed before touching down: revert (;) and Up, Down for a manual on the way
# down onto the vert ramp. On the landing the board reverts and the manual starts: the combo carries
# on through "Kickflip + Revert + Manual" and banks when the manual is ollied out of.
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
tap flip+left 212
tap revert 346
tap up 348
tap down 352
bot balance
hold ollie 470..480
run 700
expect event revert within 354..358
expect event manualStart{trick=Manual} within 354..358
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Revert + Manual,multiplier=3} within 480..700
expect no event bail
